Plain Old Text - Project Environment Context

## Domain
- Public site: https://sources.vjbe.net (`$site_url` in `html/data.php`; citations and canonical tags derive from it).
- Scans are served from https://oldnews-photos.vjbe.net.

## Deployment & Path Architecture
- Physical Path: /home/elgersmav/html/oldnews/
- Production Path (Symlink Target): /var/www/vjbe.net/html/oldnews/
- Base Directory Configuration ($base_dir): /var/www/vjbe.net/html/oldnews

## Routing System
- Front controller: `./html/index.php`; article metadata comes from `data.php`.
- Routes: `/` redirects to `/catalogue`; `/about`, `/contribute`.
- `/stable/<id>` is each article's canonical URL (`<id>` is the permanent 5-character id in `data.json`), with `/stable/<id>/scans` and `/stable/<id>/markdown`; all take `?edition=<name>`.
- Old slug URLs (`/<slug>`, `/<slug>/scans`, `/<slug>/markdown`) and `/photocopy/<slug>` 301-redirect to their stable URLs.
- Views: `about.php`, `contribute.php`, `catalogue.php`, partials in `partials/`, wrapped by `layout.php`.

## Deployment Mechanics
- `./dev` runs the local PHP development server (`php -S localhost:8000 -t html html/index.php`).
- Deploy operations executed via `./deploy` shell executable script.
